B.acI=new A.l2("\ud83c\udccf","Welcome to Capture Tens","A strategic 4-player trick-taking card game where your goal is to capture the most 10s!","You play in teams of 2 (seats 0+2 vs 1+3)",B.S)
B.acF=new A.l2("\ud83c\udfaf","Capture the 10s","The team that captures the most 10-value cards over 13 tricks wins the match. There are four 10s in the deck \u2014 one per suit.","Tiebreakers: most 10s, then most cards, then most aces",B.f)
B.acJ=new A.l2("\u26a1","The Power Suit","Before play begins, the first player chooses a Power Suit (trump) after seeing their first 5 cards. Cards of this suit beat ALL other suits!","Choose the suit you have the most cards in",B.fD)
B.acG=new A.l2("\ud83c\udccf","Follow the Lead","The first player in each trick leads a card. You MUST play the same suit if you have it.","If you can't follow suit, you can play any card",B.S)
B.acK=new A.l2("\u2b06\ufe0f","Play Higher","If following the lead suit, you must play a HIGHER card than the current highest \u2014 unless your teammate is already winning!","Card order: A > K > Q > J > 10 > 9 > 8 > 7 > 6 > 5 > 4 > 3 > 2",B.S)
